-- Boss and loot data for the dungeon detail page in the Groups tab.
-- WoW: Forever has no Encounter Journal, so this is typed in from web guides
-- (mainly method.gg/wow-forever/dungeons). Forever loot can differ from the
-- classic game, so the Forever pages were preferred where they exist.
-- Keys match the activity ids in Data/GroupActivities.lua.
-- A dungeon with no entry shows "No details for this one yet." on its page.

-- Written to the global GuildOS, as Data/GroupActivities.lua is: the Groups panel reads it there.
